The '''warehouse district''' was a district within<ref name="Art of Mando 2" /> a barren [[city]]<ref name="Mando Mayhem 210">{{InsiderCite|210|Mandalorian Mayhem}}</ref> located on [[RTK111|an Outer Rim planet]]. A [[Gor Koresh's Honky Tonk|carnita arena]] was located in the district.<ref name="Art of Mando 2" /> [[Din Djarin]] visited [[Gor Koresh]] while he was in the town. A group of [[wild dog]]s inhabited the abandoned industrial buildings of the town. They tended to recoil from light.<ref name="Chapter 9" />

